  "description": "eeCLOUD is a library that allows you to manage the DB automatically using a NoSQL approach by creating a new DB for each new Application and the memory objects inside it will correspond to the tables. By saving elements like JSON you can take advantage of different methods that allow you to work directly on the JSON object. eeCLOUD works with MySQL, MsSQL and PostgreSQL servers.",
